# Silverquill, the Disputant: "Each instant and sorcery spell you cast has casualty 1" (CR 702.153a, 604.1). Bot1 plays a Black Lotus
# and three Moxes, casts Llanowar Elves and Silverquill (the Lotus's three Green, Pearl, Jet), then Lightning Bolt with Ruby. The
# Bolt is cast with casualty: Bot1 sacrifices the Elves (a creature with power 1, as little as the cost asks) and the casualty
# trigger copies the Bolt (CR 707.10), the copy given a new target (CR 707.10c). The Bolt hits Bot2, the copy Bot1: each loses
# 3. The copy is no card, so only the Bolt and the Elves (and the spent Lotus) are in Bot1's graveyard, and Silverquill, not sacrificed, stays.

